22
00:00:53,569 --> 00:00:55,540
How do you explain this?

23
00:00:59,120 --> 00:01:00,880
The breakup is my business.

24
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:02,511
It has nothing to do with anyone else.

25
00:02:32,352 --> 00:02:35,998
[Episode 10]

26
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:39,440
The entire trending list right now

27
00:02:39,440 --> 00:02:41,880
