162
00:10:27,560 --> 00:10:30,080
<i>You don't need to apologize to me.</i>

163
00:10:32,680 --> 00:10:34,600
Dan Yi.

164
00:10:34,600 --> 00:10:36,560
I mean...

165
00:10:37,600 --> 00:10:39,840
