Look.

176
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:49,040
How alike we are.

177
00:11:50,440 --> 00:11:52,760
Both trapped in love.

178
00:11:53,440 --> 00:11:55,627
And both scrutinized by desire.

179
00:11:59,080 --> 00:12:01,560
I'm not like you.

180
00:12:07,120 --> 00:12:09,280
Not like me?

181
00:12:14,920 --> 00:12:16,960
Different?

182
00:12:19,400 --> 00:12:21,640
At the beginning,

183
00:12:21,640 --> 00:12:24,760
I didn't know I'd fall in love with a man.

184
00:12:26,560 --> 00:12:28,920
It's not me you're resisting.

185
00:12:30,640 --> 00:12:32,880
It's yourself.

186
00:12:35,320 --> 00:12:37,400
In this film,

187
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:43,440
