202
00:13:49,560 --> 00:13:51,720
Mr. Zhang, let's do the touch-up later.

203
00:13:51,720 --> 00:13:53,240
The crew has arranged a film promotion.

204
00:13:53,240 --> 00:13:55,840
The director wants you to record it
before coming back to shoot.

205
00:13:55,840 --> 00:13:57,080
Film promotion?

206
00:13:57,080 --> 00:13:58,080
Yes.

207
00:13:58,080 --> 00:14:00,240
It's a live broadcast.

208
00:14:01,200 --> 00:14:03,240
Okay.

209
00:14:03,240 --> 00:14:04,200
I... I'll be right there.

210
