Hey, Zhun.

221
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:11,920
Did you two script this interview?

222
00:15:11,920 --> 00:15:12,960
That was brilliant.

223
00:15:12,960 --> 00:15:16,040
Netizens were saying you
and Mr. Zhen don't get along.

224
00:15:16,040 --> 00:15:18,760
Now they're absolutely sure
the crew staged the scandal for hype.

225
00:15:18,760 --> 00:15:20,440
Look at this.

226
00:15:23,960 --> 00:15:27,640
<i>Solo fans are at war, while my CP is kissing.</i>

227
00:15:27,640 --> 00:15:31,320
<i>I don't buy it. Only CP fans believe
queerbaiting can be real.</i>

228
00:15:31,320 --> 00:15:35,040
<i>But Mr. Zhen is very professional.</i>

229
00:16:37,680 --> 00:16:39,240
Doctor...

230
00:16:39,240 --> 00:16:42,360
You... You're Dr. Fang.

231
00:16:45,920 --> 00:16:47,240
Yes.

232
00:16:47,240 --> 00:16:49,040
I am.

233
00:16:53,360 --> 00:16:55,560
Dr. Fang.

234
00:16:55,560 --> 00:16:58,720
Don't leave me, please.

235
00:16:58,720 --> 00:17:00,040
Don't leave me alone.

236
00:17:00,040 --> 00:17:02,480
Okay, I won't leave you.

237
00:17:02,480 --> 00:17:04,800
I'll take you somewhere fun now.

238
00:17:04,800 --> 00:17:06,640
Will you come?

239
00:17:07,360 --> 00:17:08,600
Okay.

240
00:17:08,600 --> 00:17:12,080
Wherever you take me, that's where I'll go.

241
00:17:12,080 --> 00:17:13,985
Okay, let's go.

242
00:17:19,480 --> 00:17:21,480
Hey, listen.

243
00:17:21,480 --> 00:17:22,880
The one on the dance floor just now...

244
00:17:22,880 --> 00:17:25,880
He was totally my type.

245
00:17:25,880 --> 00:17:29,027
Pity he was snatched away
by that guy in the white coat.

246
00:17:34,440 --> 00:17:36,400
Mr. Gao?

247
00:17:36,400 --> 00:17:38,543
Hey, where are you going?

248
00:17:52,520 --> 00:17:54,032
Fuck.

249
00:18:03,120 --> 00:18:04,760
Come in.

250
00:18:12,120 --> 00:18:13,600
Mr. Gao.

251
00:18:13,600 --> 00:18:15,920
