267
00:18:56,560 --> 00:18:59,320
And I don't like people coming to my house.

268
00:19:01,479 --> 00:19:04,080
Mr. Gao, Fang...

269
00:19:05,880 --> 00:19:07,960
That person...

270
00:19:07,960 --> 00:19:09,920
