You're a bottom, right?

277
00:19:38,640 --> 00:19:40,580
We'd be a perfect match.

278
00:19:42,440 --> 00:19:45,320
Your shirt's buttoned up so high today.

279
00:19:45,320 --> 00:19:49,160
Are you afraid people will see the marks?

280
00:19:49,160 --> 00:19:51,640
Whatever they can do,

281
00:19:52,360 --> 00:19:54,680
I can do, too.

282
00:19:59,720 --> 00:20:01,846
Do what?

283
00:20:01,846 --> 00:20:05,080
Be the relationship target in your fantasies?

284
00:20:05,080 --> 00:20:07,400
Let you do whatever you want?

285
00:20:07,400 --> 00:20:10,080
Or satisfy...

286
00:20:12,040 --> 00:20:14,530
your twisted sense of accomplishment?

287
00:20:18,560 --> 00:20:20,160
Justin.

288
00:20:20,160 --> 00:20:22,320
I am your mentor.

289
00:20:22,320 --> 00:20:26,760
In this industry,
I have the power to destroy you.

290
00:20:26,760 --> 00:20:29,360
Don't even think about
trying anything with me.

291
00:20:29,360 --> 00:20:34,280
Otherwise, I won't hesitate
to use any means to deal with you.

292
00:20:34,280 --> 00:20:36,040
Get out.

293
00:20:44,840 --> 00:20:48,080
I clearly saw you with someone last night.

294
00:20:48,080 --> 00:20:49,870
Why can't it be me?

295
00:20:50,840 --> 00:20:52,960
Hey, we're here.

296
00:21:10,680 --> 00:21:13,640
You're not him. Go away.

297
00:21:13,640 --> 00:21:17,340
Come on. Everyone's the same
with the lights off.

298
00:21:17,340 --> 00:21:19,520
Go away! I'm sick!

299
00:21:19,520 --> 00:21:22,320
Only my dear Dr. Fang can touch me.

300
00:21:22,320 --> 00:21:24,720
You're sick?

301
00:21:24,720 --> 00:21:27,960
Damn it. What bad luck.

302
00:21:35,720 --> 00:21:39,320
Anyone can, but you can't.

303
00:21:39,320 --> 00:21:42,040
Because he said...

304
00:21:42,040 --> 00:21:45,519
He doesn't like you.

305
00:21:49,480 --> 00:21:51,080
Cut. Moving on.

306
00:21:51,080 --> 00:21:53,240
Zhun, look who's here.

307
00:21:53,240 --> 00:21:55,800
- Zhun, I'm back again.
- Wu Rong.

308
00:21:55,800 --> 00:21:57,583
I'll leave you two to talk.

309
00:21:59,160 --> 00:22:00,760
Wh-Why are you here?

310
00:22:00,760 --> 00:22:01,840
A surprise set visit?

311
00:22:01,840 --> 00:22:04,720
What do you mean "visit"?

312
00:22:04,720 --> 00:22:06,440
I was dragged back to reshoot a few scenes.

313
00:22:06,440 --> 00:22:08,544
Wait, you didn't know?

314
00:22:12,260 --> 00:22:14,449
Hey, our...

315
00:22:19,560 --> 00:22:21,480
The ending of the movie was changed.

316
00:22:21,480 --> 00:22:24,640
The scenes where we live together were all cut.

317
00:22:24,640 --> 00:22:26,600
I freaking suspect...

318
00:22:26,600 --> 00:22:29,400
that our Best Actor is behind this.

319
00:22:29,400 --> 00:22:31,200
Don't make assumptions.

320
00:22:35,200 --> 00:22:38,520
I saw the news. Are you okay?

321
00:22:42,920 --> 00:22:45,640
I'm fine. It'll be dealt with.

322
00:22:47,680 --> 00:22:51,480
It's all because of that psycho. Damn it.

323
00:22:51,480 --> 00:22:54,480
Hey. I have a scene with him tomorrow.

324
00:22:54,480 --> 00:22:56,920
The kind where I beat him up.

325
00:22:56,920 --> 00:22:58,960
I'll teach him a lesson for you then.

326
00:22:58,960 --> 00:23:00,120
It's really not like that.

327
00:23:00,120 --> 00:23:01,880
And Wu Rong...

328
00:23:02,760 --> 00:23:05,480
Don't be too rough on him.

329
00:23:05,480 --> 00:23:07,040
Rough?

330
00:23:07,040 --> 00:23:08,600
Me?

331
00:23:08,600 --> 00:23:11,140
Heavy-handed? Rough?

332
00:23:12,840 --> 00:23:15,747
He's not trained in martial arts, after all.

333
00:23:20,000 --> 00:23:21,640
Where are they?

334
00:23:25,040 --> 00:23:26,560
Lying low.

335
00:23:26,560 --> 00:23:28,840
They said they're shooting
in two separate groups.

336
00:23:28,840 --> 00:23:31,120
Today, they're with Director Chen.

337
00:23:31,120 --> 00:23:33,560
They're doing the scene
in the psychotherapist's office.

338
00:23:33,560 --> 00:23:36,120
Oh, that's good.

339
00:23:43,720 --> 00:23:45,240
The script changes are quite good.

340
00:23:45,240 --> 00:23:46,800
They suit my temperament.

341
00:23:46,800 --> 00:23:50,187
But Director Chen, for the kiss scene later,

342
00:23:50,187 --> 00:23:51,985
can we use a camera angle instead?

343
00:23:53,040 --> 00:23:55,040
You did the male-male scene for real,

344
00:23:55,040 --> 00:23:57,040
but you want an angle for the male-female?

345
00:23:57,040 --> 00:23:58,960
Don't mess around.

346
00:24:00,080 --> 00:24:03,520
Confirming the rumors won't do you any good.

347
00:24:03,520 --> 00:24:05,400
Besides, if you want to go crazy,

348
00:24:05,400 --> 00:24:08,520
don't drag the whole crew with you.

349
00:24:08,520 --> 00:24:10,920
The producer and Ms. Qin...

350
00:24:10,920 --> 00:24:14,120
She was blowing up my phone last night.

351
00:24:15,720 --> 00:24:17,680
Mr. Zhen, Director Chen.

352
00:24:17,680 --> 00:24:20,000
Long time no see.

353
00:24:20,960 --> 00:24:23,120
Xun Er, have a seat.

354
00:24:28,040 --> 00:24:29,560
Why are you here so early?

355
00:24:29,560 --> 00:24:31,080
Your scene isn't until later.

356
00:24:31,080 --> 00:24:34,640
I came early to learn and observe.

357
00:24:34,640 --> 00:24:36,440
I see.

358
00:24:37,360 --> 00:24:39,360
- What we're filming is...
<i>- It's a shame we're in separate groups.</i>

359
00:24:39,360 --> 00:24:41,720
<i>I won't get to see your look today.</i>

360
00:24:41,720 --> 00:24:44,240
I've prepared a lot for this scene.

361
00:24:44,240 --> 00:24:48,280
Director, you must
watch my performance closely.

362
00:24:53,080 --> 00:24:55,767
Mr. Zhen, what are you smiling at?

363
00:24:55,767 --> 00:24:57,760
A work message.

364
00:24:57,760 --> 00:24:59,200
A work message?

365
00:24:59,200 --> 00:25:02,015
How can a work message
make you smile so happily?

366
00:25:02,015 --> 00:25:06,840
Then when will you
smile more at me, your work partner?

367
00:25:06,840 --> 00:25:08,880
Hey, Director Chen.

368
00:25:08,880 --> 00:25:10,439
We're shooting in sequence, right?

369
00:25:10,439 --> 00:25:11,627
Yes.

370
00:25:12,560 --> 00:25:15,160
You two have a chat, I'll go set up Camera A.

371
00:25:15,160 --> 00:25:17,080
- Okay, Director.
- DP!

372
00:25:17,080 --> 00:25:19,840
Bring Camera A over. Let me check the angle.

373
00:25:25,780 --> 00:25:29,880
Mr. Zhen, I feel like you've changed lately.

374
00:25:29,880 --> 00:25:32,080
You used to be quite arrogant.

375
00:25:32,080 --> 00:25:35,470
But now, you're actually quite likable.

376
00:25:36,440 --> 00:25:38,963
Are you saying I've become more tactful?

377
00:25:40,600 --> 00:25:42,480
No.

378
00:25:42,480 --> 00:25:44,240
It's like your whole body

379
00:25:44,240 --> 00:25:47,280
is about to burst into flames.

380
00:25:47,280 --> 00:25:49,440
Anyway, you've broke up with your girlfriend.

381
00:25:49,440 --> 00:25:52,240
Why don't you come see me tonight?

382
00:25:52,240 --> 00:25:54,525
No, thanks.

383
00:25:59,579 --> 00:26:01,760
Why are you pretending to be so chaste?

384
00:26:01,760 --> 00:26:05,240
If you're not up for it,
I'll go find Zhang Zhun.

385
00:26:31,960 --> 00:26:34,240
I've been taking the medicine.

386
00:26:35,840 --> 00:26:38,680
My sleep is much better.

387
00:26:38,680 --> 00:26:40,640
My emotions are more stable, too.

388
00:26:40,640 --> 00:26:41,680
All right.

389
00:26:41,680 --> 00:26:43,720
Adjust the dosage yourself,

390
00:26:43,720 --> 00:26:45,800
and keep up with the counseling.

391
00:26:47,160 --> 00:26:51,000
This past month, has he contacted you?

392
00:26:51,840 --> 00:26:53,352
No.

393
00:26:54,960 --> 00:26:57,018
Not since that phone call.

394
00:26:58,360 --> 00:27:00,633
Not once.

395
00:27:00,633 --> 00:27:03,546
Then what if he calls you?

396
00:27:03,546 --> 00:27:05,315
Will you answer?

397
00:27:13,120 --> 00:27:15,320
No.

398
00:27:15,320 --> 00:27:16,880
That's why I'm in pain.

399
00:27:16,880 --> 00:27:18,480
Because...

400
00:27:22,520 --> 00:27:24,180
I'm sorry.

401
00:27:30,720 --> 00:27:34,640
No psychiatrist wants to
fall in love with their patient.

402
00:27:42,600 --> 00:27:44,280
I think I'm going crazy.

403
00:27:44,280 --> 00:27:45,920
I feel like he loves me, too.

404
00:27:45,920 --> 00:27:47,880
Fang Chi.

405
00:27:47,880 --> 00:27:50,240
You know the consequences of doing this.

406
00:27:50,240 --> 00:27:53,280
As your supervisor, I can't just ignore it.

407
00:27:53,280 --> 00:27:57,121
And as your friend,
I can't watch you sink like this.

408
00:27:58,360 --> 00:27:59,989
It's too late.

409
00:28:02,000 --> 00:28:04,026
Let's suspend the treatment.

410
00:28:05,760 --> 00:28:07,534
I won't be coming next week.

411
00:28:08,680 --> 00:28:10,400
Fang Chi.

412
00:28:13,320 --> 00:28:15,960
Just let me be.

413
00:28:15,960 --> 00:28:18,760
Now, no matter what I'm doing,

414
00:28:18,760 --> 00:28:20,840
or where I am,

415
00:28:21,520 --> 00:28:24,080
he's the only thing on my mind.

416
00:28:59,200 --> 00:29:01,680
Dr. Fang.

417
00:29:01,680 --> 00:29:03,720
Didn't you say...

418
00:29:04,560 --> 00:29:06,988
that you and I were just a dream?

419
00:29:10,600 --> 00:29:13,320
But why can't I wake up?

420
00:29:28,200 --> 00:29:30,000
Don't go.

421
00:29:30,000 --> 00:29:31,800
Don't...

422
00:30:21,360 --> 00:30:23,760
Mr. Gao, you're awake.

423
00:30:26,446 --> 00:30:28,120
Are you...

424
00:30:28,120 --> 00:30:30,400
the property security guard, Zou?

425
00:30:30,400 --> 00:30:32,800
Mr. Gao, it's me. Zou Yun.

426
00:30:32,800 --> 00:30:35,640
I saw you collapsed in the snow
when I was changing shifts last night.

427
00:30:35,640 --> 00:30:38,400
I couldn't wake you up,
and I couldn't open your door,

428
00:30:38,400 --> 00:30:40,200
so I had to bring you to my place.

429
00:30:40,200 --> 00:30:43,090
Then... why am I...

430
00:30:44,120 --> 00:30:45,480
Your clothes...

431
00:30:45,480 --> 00:30:47,280
You threw up on them last night.

432
00:30:47,280 --> 00:30:48,520
I had no choice.

433
00:30:48,520 --> 00:30:49,720
I had to take them off for you.

434
00:30:49,720 --> 00:30:51,680
I'm sorry.

435
00:30:51,680 --> 00:30:54,480
Please give them back to me.

436
00:30:54,480 --> 00:30:56,360
They were too dirty and smelly.

437
00:30:56,360 --> 00:30:59,680
I washed them, but they're not dry yet.

438
00:30:59,680 --> 00:31:01,760
Why don't you wear mine for now?

439
00:31:01,760 --> 00:31:02,920
No, thanks.

440
00:31:03,800 --> 00:31:05,840
I only wear my own clothes.

441
00:31:05,840 --> 00:31:08,551
So, please give them back.

442
00:31:24,920 --> 00:31:26,200
Mr. Gao.

443
00:31:26,200 --> 00:31:27,520
I have hot porridge and pancakes.

444
00:31:27,520 --> 00:31:28,800
Let's eat together.

445
00:31:28,800 --> 00:31:29,862
No, that's not necessary.

446
00:31:29,862 --> 00:31:32,080
I have things to do, so I'll be going.

447
00:31:32,080 --> 00:31:33,400
Look at me.

448
00:31:33,400 --> 00:31:37,160
I'm being impulsive again.
I always forget my place.

449
00:31:37,160 --> 00:31:39,520
That's not what I meant.

450
00:31:40,920 --> 00:31:43,440
I just...

451
00:31:43,440 --> 00:31:45,080
don't really like porridge.

452
00:31:45,080 --> 00:31:49,080
Sorry for imposing
on you last night. Thank you.

453
00:32:01,662 --> 00:32:04,724
[Puzzle]

454
00:32:16,800 --> 00:32:17,880
Hey, handsome.

455
00:32:17,880 --> 00:32:19,000
Are you alone?

456
00:32:19,000 --> 00:32:21,040
Let's get to know each other.

457
00:32:22,760 --> 00:32:25,080
Playing hard to get?

458
00:32:28,480 --> 00:32:30,120
Get lost.

459
00:32:30,120 --> 00:32:32,195
I'm being nice, and you're being a jerk.

460
00:32:35,520 --> 00:32:37,550
Who the hell are you?

461
00:32:43,240 --> 00:32:44,524
Get lost.

462
00:32:45,800 --> 00:32:48,415
Mr. Gao, let's go.

463
00:32:56,520 --> 00:32:58,076
Why are you here?

464
00:32:59,120 --> 00:33:00,320
The night before last,

465
00:33:00,320 --> 00:33:02,600
I also found you outside this bar.

466
00:33:02,600 --> 00:33:03,880
I suddenly thought,

467
00:33:03,880 --> 00:33:06,480
"What if he gets drunk again
and passes out on the street?"

468
00:33:06,480 --> 00:33:07,720
So, I came to check on you.

469
00:33:07,720 --> 00:33:10,459
And I saw someone harassing you.

470
00:33:12,840 --> 00:33:15,200
How can I thank you?

471
00:33:18,280 --> 00:33:19,560
Let's have a meal.

472
00:33:19,560 --> 00:33:22,194
I'm hungry.

473
00:33:25,280 --> 00:33:27,641
Here, have some.

474
00:33:34,560 --> 00:33:36,720
What's wrong? Not used to street food?

475
00:33:36,720 --> 00:33:38,240
No.

476
00:33:38,240 --> 00:33:39,936
I just don't have much of an appetite.

477
00:33:40,960 --> 00:33:42,440
Hey.

478
00:33:42,440 --> 00:33:43,600
No matter how hard things get,

479
00:33:43,600 --> 00:33:45,880
as long as there's good food and good drinks,

480
00:33:45,880 --> 00:33:47,551
it's not a big deal.

481
00:34:03,600 --> 00:34:04,600
Hey.

482
00:34:04,600 --> 00:34:08,080
The guy... who took you home that time.

483
00:34:08,080 --> 00:34:09,960
Why did he leave you all alone?

484
00:34:09,960 --> 00:34:11,922
Why wasn't he there with you?

485
00:34:11,922 --> 00:34:13,564
He's my doctor.

486
00:34:15,400 --> 00:34:17,167
Once the patient is cured,

487
00:34:19,280 --> 00:34:22,120
there's no reason to meet again.

488
00:34:22,120 --> 00:34:23,400
I understand.

489
00:34:23,400 --> 00:34:25,960
For some people, once they enter your heart,

490
00:34:25,960 --> 00:34:27,960
they never leave.

491
00:34:29,200 --> 00:34:32,992
Actually, it's not that person who's trapped.

492
00:34:35,233 --> 00:34:37,030
It's yourself.

493
00:34:38,920 --> 00:34:40,360
Even when that person is gone,

494
00:34:40,360 --> 00:34:42,680
you're the one who can't get out.

495
00:34:56,000 --> 00:34:57,240
Hello.

496
00:34:57,240 --> 00:34:58,980
<i>Where are you?</i>

497
00:35:00,320 --> 00:35:02,720
I'm...

498
00:35:02,720 --> 00:35:04,080
having dinner with a friend.

499
00:35:04,080 --> 00:35:05,659
<i>What do you mean?</i>

500
00:35:05,659 --> 00:35:07,213
<i>You knew I was coming back today,</i>

501
00:35:07,213 --> 00:35:09,600
<i>yet you're out with a friend at midnight?</i>

502
00:35:09,600 --> 00:35:11,800
<i>I didn't even know you had friends.</i>

503
00:35:11,800 --> 00:35:13,720
<i>Gao Zhun, stop pretending.</i>

504
00:35:13,720 --> 00:35:15,360
<i>I don't agree to your proposal.</i>

505
00:35:15,360 --> 00:35:16,600
<i>Come back right now. We need to...</i>

506
00:35:16,600 --> 00:35:17,922
Lin Lin.

507
00:35:17,922 --> 00:35:19,480
I've already told you.

508
00:35:19,480 --> 00:35:20,880
I've fallen in love with someone else.

509
00:35:20,880 --> 00:35:22,520
I can't love you anymore.

510
00:35:22,520 --> 00:35:23,920
Stop being so stubborn.

511
00:35:23,920 --> 00:35:26,680
I've left the compensation agreement
in the study drawer.

512
00:35:26,680 --> 00:35:27,888
Just sign it.

513
00:35:27,888 --> 00:35:30,568
This is my most sincere apology to you.

514
00:35:31,520 --> 00:35:33,506
I won't be coming back for a few days.

515
00:35:34,560 --> 00:35:37,800
You... should move out soon.

516
00:35:53,800 --> 00:35:55,480
This liquor is strong.

517
00:35:55,480 --> 00:35:56,800
It's not for you.

518
00:35:56,800 --> 00:35:58,840
Forget it, Mr. Gao.

519
00:35:58,840 --> 00:36:01,553
Why isn't it for me?

520
00:36:01,553 --> 00:36:03,860
I'll make it for me.

521
00:36:17,200 --> 00:36:20,120
You're in a lot of pain, aren't you?

522
00:36:21,320 --> 00:36:23,800
I understand that kind of pain.

523
00:36:23,800 --> 00:36:25,880
Because I once...

524
00:36:25,880 --> 00:36:27,560
I also used this kind of physical pain...

525
00:36:27,560 --> 00:36:30,080
to make up for the pain in my heart.

526
00:36:32,280 --> 00:36:34,320
What's your pain?

527
00:36:37,560 --> 00:36:39,480
Loving someone I can't have.

528
00:36:40,920 --> 00:36:42,840
Just...

529
00:36:43,920 --> 00:36:45,920
the impossible kind.

530
00:36:46,800 --> 00:36:48,940
That's why I'm alone.

531
00:37:08,080 --> 00:37:10,000
He and I...

532
00:37:12,200 --> 00:37:14,200
aren't meant to be.

533
00:37:15,360 --> 00:37:17,400
So...

534
00:37:17,400 --> 00:37:19,840
I also love someone I can't have.

535
00:37:23,320 --> 00:37:25,000
I guess so.

536
00:37:26,560 --> 00:37:28,840
Don't think too much. Eat more.

537
00:37:30,360 --> 00:37:33,480
Oh, it's fine.

538
00:37:34,520 --> 00:37:36,480
Come on.

539
00:37:36,480 --> 00:37:38,240
A toast to the past.

540
00:37:48,920 --> 00:37:50,520
Come on, take it easy.

541
00:37:54,080 --> 00:37:55,900
This isn't my home.

542
00:37:55,900 --> 00:37:57,560
It's not Dr. Fang's home either.

543
00:37:57,560 --> 00:38:00,040
I'm not staying.

544
00:38:00,040 --> 00:38:03,520
This is my place. You've been here.

545
00:38:03,520 --> 00:38:05,600
It's okay.

546
00:38:05,600 --> 00:38:07,640
You take the bed.

547
00:38:07,640 --> 00:38:09,040
I'll sleep on the sofa.

548
00:38:09,040 --> 00:38:11,240
It's fine. Really.

549
00:38:12,560 --> 00:38:15,200
Dr. Fang...

550
00:38:15,200 --> 00:38:18,487
I want some water, Dr. Fang.

551
00:38:57,800 --> 00:38:59,440
- Mr. Gao.
- Yeah?

552
00:38:59,440 --> 00:39:01,440
Drink some water before you sleep.

553
00:39:02,680 --> 00:39:05,460
Here, take it slow.

554
00:39:21,560 --> 00:39:23,920
Why did it take you so long to answer my calls?

555
00:39:23,920 --> 00:39:26,160
And why were you so slow to open the door?

556
00:39:27,960 --> 00:39:29,240
I was taking a nap.

557
00:39:29,240 --> 00:39:30,640
Is something wrong?

558
00:39:30,640 --> 00:39:32,520
I want to live with you for a while.

559
00:39:32,520 --> 00:39:34,120
Stop messing around.

560
00:39:34,120 --> 00:39:36,600
I've made my stance very clear.

561
00:39:37,560 --> 00:39:39,000
We shouldn't see each other anymore.

562
00:39:39,000 --> 00:39:40,240
You should take care of Gao Zhun.

563
00:39:40,240 --> 00:39:41,960
Take care of him?

564
00:39:41,960 --> 00:39:45,520
Who knows what kind of lowlifes
he's fooling around with right now.

565
00:39:45,520 --> 00:39:47,160
That's impossible.

566
00:39:47,160 --> 00:39:48,646
I've been back for a week.

567
00:39:48,646 --> 00:39:51,080
He's never home, and he won't answer my calls.

568
00:39:51,080 --> 00:39:53,440
If he's not seeing someone else,
then what is it?

569
00:39:56,614 --> 00:39:58,294
[Gao Zhun]

570
00:39:59,440 --> 00:40:02,240
<i>The number you have dialed
is currently unavailable.</i>

571
00:40:02,240 --> 00:40:04,720
<i>Please try again later.</i>

572
00:40:10,240 --> 00:40:12,433
See? I wasn't lying to you.

573
00:40:12,433 --> 00:40:15,160
Enough, Fang Chi. Let's ignore him.

574
00:40:15,160 --> 00:40:16,470
Let's...

575
00:40:17,560 --> 00:40:19,640
Where are you going?

576
00:40:24,840 --> 00:40:27,160
<i>Where would you go?</i>

577
00:40:28,253 --> 00:40:31,013
<i>Where could you possibly go?</i>

578
00:40:50,600 --> 00:40:52,120
Let's have hot pot tonight.

579
00:40:52,120 --> 00:40:53,120
Hey, you know what?

580
00:40:53,120 --> 00:40:54,154
Since you moved in,

581
00:40:54,154 --> 00:40:57,580
it feels much more like a home
than when I was living alone.

582
00:40:59,800 --> 00:41:01,373
Is it inappropriate for me

583
00:41:01,373 --> 00:41:03,040
to be staying at your place like this?

584
00:41:03,040 --> 00:41:04,266
What's inappropriate about it?

585
00:41:04,266 --> 00:41:06,360
You can stay as long as you want.

586
00:41:06,360 --> 00:41:09,400
I'm used to sleeping on the sofa now.

587
00:41:10,160 --> 00:41:13,680
I didn't expect to
sleep so soundly at your place.

588
00:41:40,169 --> 00:41:43,194
[Happy Together]

589
00:41:44,960 --> 00:41:47,440
This is my favorite song.

590
00:41:47,440 --> 00:41:48,866
It's in Cantonese.

591
00:41:48,866 --> 00:41:51,106
I can't understand the lyrics.

592
00:45:35,280 --> 00:45:37,200
Mr. Gao hasn't been here for days.

593
00:45:37,200 --> 00:45:39,440
I can't get in touch with him either.

594
00:45:41,160 --> 00:45:43,520
Dr. Fang.

595
00:45:43,520 --> 00:45:44,560
What is it?

596
00:45:44,560 --> 00:45:46,680
Are you here to see Mr. Gao?

597
00:45:46,680 --> 00:45:48,920
I slept with him.

598
00:45:52,760 --> 00:45:54,720
I'm warning you.

599
00:45:54,720 --> 00:45:57,640
Don't talk nonsense.

600
00:45:57,640 --> 00:45:58,840
What?

601
00:45:58,840 --> 00:46:00,360
You don't want him anymore,

602
00:46:00,360 --> 00:46:02,520
but you won't let him sleep with others?

603
00:46:03,800 --> 00:46:07,800
Listen, he didn't just sleep with me.

604
00:46:07,800 --> 00:46:10,000
He's slept with many people.

